{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1783256971095,"sessionID":"ses_0cd9bf487ffeYqFG9RbpydD8aU","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_00_vP9cECS7FqY1YyJva0BT6261","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{
  "summary": "node-addon-api 是 Node-API (N-API) 的 header-only C++ 包装类库，为 Node.js 原生插件（native addon）开发者提供 C++ 对象模型和异常处理语义。它将底层 C 语言的 Node-API 函数（napi_*）封装为 C++ 类（如 Napi::Value、Napi::Object、Napi::Function 等），支持 RAII、模板类型安全和 C++ 异常，大幅简化了编写跨 Node.js 大版本兼容的原生插件的复杂度。",
  "categories": [
    {
      "name": "JavaScript 值类型封装",
      "description": "将 JavaScript 的基本类型和引用类型（Undefined/Null/Boolean/Number/String/Object/Array/Function/Promise/ArrayBuffer/TypedArray/DataView/BigInt/Date/Symbol/External/Buffer）包装为 C++ 类，提供类型检查、类型转换和属性操作",
      "evidence": ["napi.h:211-258 (forward declarations of Value/Boolean/Number/String/Object/Array/Function etc.)", "napi.h:465-581 (Value class definition)"]
    },
    {
      "name": "异步工作器",
      "description": "提供 AsyncWorker 基类，支持在 libuv 线程池中执行 C++ 后台任务，完成后自动回调 JavaScript。AsyncProgressWorker 支持执行过程中向 JS 线程报告进度",
      "evidence": ["napi.h:3384-3388 (AsyncWorker declarations)", "napi-inl.h (AsyncWorker inline implementations)"]
    },
    {
      "name": "线程安全函数",
      "description": "提供 ThreadSafeFunction 和 TypedThreadSafeFunction，允许从多个 C++ 工作线程安全地调用 JavaScript 回调函数，支持阻塞/非阻塞调用模式和引用计数管理",
      "evidence": ["napi.h:3386-3387 (ThreadSafeFunction/TypedThreadSafeFunction prototypes)", "napi-inl.h (TSFN implementations)"]
    },
    {
      "name": "对象生命周期管理",
      "description": "通过 ObjectWrap 模板类将 C++ 对象附加到 JavaScript 对象上，实现 GC 友好的生命周期绑定；Reference/ObjectReference/FunctionReference 提供引用计数和弱引用支持",
      "evidence": ["napi.h:3360-3383 (ObjectWrap class hierarchy)", "napi.h:1557-1650 (Reference class)"]
    },
    {
      "name": "构建系统集成",
      "description": "提供 node-gyp 构建文件（node_addon_api.gyp、common.gypi、except.gypi、noexcept.gypi），支持有/无 C++ 异常两种模式，处理跨平台编译设置（MSVC/Xcode/Clang/GCC）",
      "evidence": ["node_addon_api.gyp", "common.gypi", "except.gypi", "noexcept.gypi", "index.js (提供 include 路径和 gyp 目标)"]
    }
  ],
  "domain": "Node.js 原生插件开发",
  "target_users": "Node.js 原生插件（native addon）开发者，特别是需要用 C++ 编写高性能 Node.js 扩展的开发者"
}
